{
  "title": "Amazingly Dense Mediterranean Steak Skewers",
  "description": "A fresh and comforting Mediterranean dish featuring sirloin steak tips, this recipe is Whole30-friendly and perfect for a weeknight dinner. The mantecare-emulsify technique used adds a rich and creamy element to the dish.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
